<concept otherprops="legal_gen_std_005_01" base="Anywhere" id="t00021">
	<title>Vehicle Identification Number (VIN)</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>specifications 
					<indexterm>vehicle identification number (VIN)</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e00048">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e00049">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25H001.eps" scale="100" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e00050">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25H001_E.eps" scale="100" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The Vehicle Identification Number (VIN) is the number used in registering your vehicle and in all legal matters pertaining to its ownership, etc.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>Written on a plate attached to the top left of the instrument panel.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Engraved on the floor under the front left or right seat. Open the cover to check the VIN.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
</concept>